    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d320">

                <pb facs="0420" n="248" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg248"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/3769</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Panama</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Price</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-10T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 10, 1917, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 11, 3.30 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your April 9, 5 p.m. Proclamation of the President is so considered and I
                    construe it to be a declaration of war in its legal effect. <pb facs="0421"
                        n="249" xml:id="pg249"/> Confirmation of said construction was obtained this
                    afternoon from Panaman President in the presence of Panaman Minister for Foreign
                    Affairs and Secretary of Government and Justice.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
